00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:48.467
&gt;&gt; Dana: I THINK PEOPLE KNEW

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:50.970
THAT SEAN AND MICHAEL: HAVE

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:53.005
KNOWN EACH OTHER FOR YEARS.

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:54.240
I HAVE NOT TALKED TO SEAN.

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:56.208
THIS IS MY PERSONAL THEORY.

00:07:54.373 --> 00:07:57.343
I THINK IF SEAN WERE TO BE ASKED

00:07:56.342 --> 00:07:59.044
TWO DAYS AGO, NAME YOUR LAWYERS,

00:07:57.476 --> 00:08:00.846
WOULD HE HAVE SAID MICHAEL: IS

00:07:59.178 --> 00:08:01.981
ONE OF HIS LAWYER'S?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:04.416
PROBABLY NOT.

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:05.351
MICHAEL COHEN SAID HE WAS THE

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.819
LAWYER OF SEAN, THE GOAL OF

00:08:05.484 --> 00:08:07.853
WHICH I THINK IS TO ASK THE

00:08:06.952 --> 00:08:08.788
JUDGE TO PROTECT ANY

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:10.089
CONVERSATIONS HE MIGHT'VE HAD

00:08:08.921 --> 00:08:11.624
WITH SEAN.

00:08:10.222 --> 00:08:12.057
HE IS SAYING YES, HE'S ADVISED

00:08:11.757 --> 00:08:15.194
ME ON THINGS.

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:16.629
YOU DON'T HAVE TOO HAVE PAID A

00:08:15.327 --> 00:08:17.196
LAWYER TO HAVE CLIENT ATTORNEY

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:18.731
PRIVILEGE.

00:08:17.596 --> 00:08:21.767
I CAN SAY KIMBERLY, YOU CAN

00:08:18.864 --> 00:08:22.201
REPRESENT ME TO BE MY LAWYER ON

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.335
SOMETHING?

00:08:22.334 --> 00:08:25.805
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: FOR A DOLLAR.

00:08:23.469 --> 00:08:26.505
&gt;&gt; Dana: FOR A DOLLAR, THEN

00:08:25.938 --> 00:08:29.642
EVERYTHING THAT WE TALK ABOUT

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:28.941
CAN BE CLIENT ATTORNEY PRIVILEGE

